<title>UK: Woolwich sets 250 mln stg seven-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Woolwich sets 250 mln stg seven-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager BZW.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WOOLWICH PLC</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN STG   BASE	 3M LIBOR  MATURITY    12.AUG.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +0.03125  PAY DATE    12.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  20 BP     ISS PRICE  99.905    LISTING     LONDON</p>
<p> MOODY/IBCA A1/AA-    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES*	FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	SENIOR, UNSECURED UNSUBORDINATED.</p>
<p>	     *25 MLN STG TRIGGER</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
